[PrintTextModified Text:……这副异形的相貌——<br>【魔女化】本身就是全部的证据。|#0205Trial08_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:魔法少女、魔女、大魔女……<br>这是证明其存在的现象。<br>我说得没错吧？|#0205Trial08_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:就假设那些东西都是真实存在的吧。|#0205Trial08_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
