[PrintTextModified Text:但我无法完全赞同<br>不说出明确理由<br>就试图让大家魔女化的行为，|#0205Trial08_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:说不定，希罗你拥有<br>【异形化】的魔法——|#0205Trial08_Margo013| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR5,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:为了制造自己的同伴而欺骗大家，<br>这个可能性也是有的吧？|#0205Trial08_Margo014| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR5,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:所以……我完全不认为<br>【魔女化】这个现象本身，跟是否能逃离这座监牢有关。|#0205Trial08_Margo015| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR5,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right
